#            02-Oct-2012/ss: Upgraded
#            28-Feb-2013/ss: Use special SAT info file
#            26-Sep-2013/lp: Re-introduce NO_LONGARCFIT.FLG if necessary
#            08-Mar-2022 AV: Rapid save disk: yearly subdirectory
